#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:550
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> - The button area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> – Knappområdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:554
msgid ""
"The button area provides two buttons, the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> and "
"the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> buttons. Clicking the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button will dismiss the dialog and return the "
"user to the worksheet. Clicking the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button will "
"cause the selected file to be opened into a worksheet, using either the "
"automatic file format type detection or the file format type specified if "
"one has been selected, and using the character encoding scheme if one has "
"been selected."
msgstr ""
"Här finns knapparna <guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton> och "
"<guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>. Om du klickar på <guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton>"
" stängs dialogrutan och du kommer tillbaka till kalkylbladet. Om du klickar "
"på <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton> öppnas den markerade filen i ett kalkylblad."
" Då används antingen den automatiska identifieringen av filformat eller det "
"format du har valt, samt den teckenkodning du har angett."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:144
msgid ""
"The purpose of each labeled component in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-"
"dialog-components\"/> is explained below: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Nedan förklaras syftet med varje märkt del i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-"
"dialog-components\"/>: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:576
msgid ""
"The procedure required to open a file into a workbook using this dialog is "
"presented next."
msgstr ""
"Därefter beskrivs hur du öppnar en fil i en arbetsbok med den här "
"dialogrutan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:586
msgid "The procedure to open an existing file."
msgstr "Så öppnar du en befintlig fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:590
msgid ""
"Opening an existing file into a workbook requires selecting the folder "
"containing the desired file, selecting the file within this folder, and "
"optionally selecting the file format type and character encoding."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill öppna en befintlig fil i en arbetsbok väljer du mappen som "
"innehåller filen och markerar filen. Vid behov väljer du också filformat och"
" teckenkodning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:598
msgid "The procedure to open a file."
msgstr "Så öppnar du en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:619 C/gnumeric.xml:26 C/gnumeric.xml:431
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Using the Menus</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Via menyerna</emphasis>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:623
msgid ""
"Select, in the <guimenu><accel>F</accel>ile</guimenu> menu, the "
"<guimenuitem><accel>O</accel>pen</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Välj menyalternativet <guimenu><accel>A</accel>rkiv</guimenu> → "
"<guimenuitem>Öpp<accel>n</accel>a</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:631 C/gnumeric.xml:37
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Using the Standard Toolbar</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Via standardverktygsfältet</emphasis>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:635
msgid ""
"Click on the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button: <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-"
"open.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the open file button.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon>"
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>: <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-"
"open.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"knappen för att öppna en fil.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> "
"</guiicon>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:652 C/gnumeric.xml:57 C/gnumeric.xml:444
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Using a Keyboard Shortcut</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Via ett kortkommando</emphasis>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:656
msgid ""
"Type the combination "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>o</keysym></keycombo>, typing both "
"keys simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Tryck samtidigt på "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>o</keysym></keycombo>."
